<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5742/5786.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5742/5786.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5742/5786 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Monday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Tuesday will be 5764.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, previous working day in Russia, the bid/offer rates were also 5742/5786, with the official dollar rate 5764 from Thursday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
</text>
